(1) CONSTANT UNIFICATION via B2 = 1/6
========================================================================
   B2 (Bernoulli) = 1/6
   zeta(2) = pi^2/6 = pi^2 * B2   (my witness-sum heartbeat 1/zeta(2), HYP-3746)
   E2 = 1 - (4/B2) sum sigma_1 q^n = 1 - 24 q - ...   (4/B2 = 24)
   Dedekind reciprocity constant 1/12 = B2/2 = 1/12
   => one Bernoulli B2 runs the witness-sum zeta(2), E2, and Dedekind reciprocity.

